# Act Two

## "So, we followed up..."

INT.  Eventide High : Councilor's Office - Afternoon #1#

COUNCILOR
So, we followed up on that initial report that you made. We sent it to the police and they're doing an intensive investigation.

CUT TO:
INT.  Eventide High : Officer's Car - AFTERNOON #2#

TED
Officer Peterson, what's up?

KEV
Long time no see, my friend!

_MUSICAL STING_

OFFICER
Did you get the evidence I was looking for?

KEV
Sure did, got it right on this card.

The OFFICER procedes to smash the card.

_MUSICAL STING_

OFFICER
What did we learn, boys?

TED
To keep our hands to ourselves and keep our mouthes shut... until the cameras aren't rolling.

KEV ^
To keep our hands to ourselves and keep our mouthes shut... until the cameras aren't rolling.



_MUSICAL STING_

CUT TO:
INT.  Eventide High : Councilor's Office - Moments Later #3#

LANA
They're gonna walk away scot free, aren't they?

COUNCILOR
Well, you have to consider both sides of the argument.

_MUSICAL STING_

COUNCILOR (CONT'D)
We both know that boys are different, boys have... urges.

_MUSICAL STING_

COUNCILOR (CONT'D)
But you have to remember that their words are just that... words.

_MUSICAL STING_

COUNCILOR (CONT'D)
And you can't allow words from here... 

The COUNCILOR points towards her mouth as if explaining the concept to a toddler.

COUNCILOR (CONT'D)
...to hurt you up here.

The COUNCILOR points to her brain. 

_MUSICAL STING_

LANA 
Believe me, your words sting more than anything else, your words make me want to rip my HEART OUT.

COUNCILOR
Are you trying to self harm?

A beat.

LANA
What?

COUNCILOR
I have to report this, you know.

Two people approach Lana from behind. The Councilor grins in a sadistic manner.

LANA
Wait.

_MUSICAL STING. BACKING TRACK FOR ARE YOU KIDDING ME (REPRISE) BEGINS._

## Are You Kidding Me (Reprise)

The people behind Lana grab her and begin to drag her offstage.

INT. Eventide High : Atrium - Moments Later #4#

LANA
Get your hands off of me, wait! Stop, for chrissake!

LIZZY
Lana, what's going on?!

LANA
They're taking me to a shrink!

LIZZY
What?!

LANA
This isn't right, this isn't fair, stop! _***Let me go!***_

LANA's scream rings out as she's dragged off stage.

_INTRO TO ARE YOU KIDDING ME (REPRISE) FINISHES. FIRST CHORUS BEGINS._

LIZZY
~CAN'T BREATHE FOR A SECOND, THOUGHT WE OVERCAME
~I BLINK FOR JUST A SECOND; LANA'S BEING DRAGGED AWAY
~IT TAKES ME LESS THAN THAT TO FIGURE JUST WHO IS TO BLAME
~THEY WANT ME TO PLAY THEIR GAME
~FALL INTO THEIR TRAP, THEIR SIGHTS ON AIM
~THIS AIN'T A BATTLE THEY WANT TO CLAIM
~THEY'RE PLAYING WITH THE WRONG DAME

TED
~Screw your little girlfriend


LIZZY
**JORDAN!**

JORDAN jumps at the mention of his name. He drops the pill bottle he was holding to the floor. He rushes to pick it back up.

JORDAN
Can't you see I'm in the middle of something?

LIZZY
Can you wait _until_ I cash in my favor to do... whatever *that* is?

JORDAN
Really?

LIZZY
You said you had my back, you can wait one more day.

JORDAN
Okay, what is it?

LIZZY
~TED AND KEV DECLARED THEIR WAR 
~I NEED ALL THE DIRT YOU CAN FIND AND THEN SOME MORE.
~GET THE PEOPLE ON OUR SIDE, POUND THEM INTO THE FLOOR
~BEFORE THEY GAIN ADVANTAGE

JORDAN
I'll see what I can manage.

JORDAN makes his way centerstage.

JORDAN
~CALLING ALL THE FOLKS OF EVENTIDE
~LANA NEEDS OUR HELP, JOIN BY HER SIDE
~AGAINST TED AND KEVIN AND THEIR SNIDE TRICKS
~WE STAND UNIFIED
~WE MAY HAVE OUR DIFFERENCES
~EVEN STILL, THE DIFFERENCE IS
~STOPPING INJUSTICE IS OUR BIZ
~NOW, WILL YOU TAKE A VOW?

JORDAN
Woo! Still got it!

STUDENTS^
~WE ARE BY YOUR SIDE NOW
~THEY'LL HEAR OUR REPLY NOW
~THEY'RE RUNNING OUT OF TIME NOW
~THEY'RE LOW TIDE NOW
